flowchart TD
    A[Missed heartbeat / failed node] --> C[Queued repair or scrub scan]
    B[Periodic integrity scrub] --> C
    C --> D[Worker locks affected chunk]
    D --> E{Enough verified source data?}
    E -- No --> X[Record degraded state; retry later]
    E -- Yes --> F[Read healthy copy / decode k shards]
    F --> G[Recreate missing fragment]
    G --> H{Distinct healthy target available?}
    H -- No --> X
    H -- Yes --> I[Write and verify fragment]
    I --> J[Commit placement and repair traffic]
    J --> K[Clean obsolete copy when reachable]
    K --> L[Update recovery dashboard]
